   <standOff><listPerson><person xml:id="person3863"><persName type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">'jad pa gzhon nu byang chub</persName><persName xml:lang="bo">འཇད་པ་གཞོན་ནུ་བྱང་ཆུབ</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">'jad pa gzhon byang</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">'jam dpal gzhon nu byang chub</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">gzhon nu byang chub skyabs</persName><birth notBefore="1140-01-01" notAfter="1160-12-31">after 1140 before 1160</birth><death notBefore="1200-01-01" notAfter="1220-12-31">after 1200 before 1220</death><sex value="M"/><nationality>Tibetan</nationality><idno type="BDRC">https://purl.bdrc.io/resource/P10015</idno><idno type="APIS">3863</idno></person><person xml:id="person4593"><persName type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">Anonymous</persName><persName xml:lang="bo">ཨཱནོཉམོཨུས</persName><sex value="M"/><nationality>Tibetan</nationality><idno type="APIS">4593</idno></person><person xml:id="person7279"><persName type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">Anonymous</persName><persName xml:lang="bo">ཨཱནོཉམོཨུས</persName><birth notBefore="1150-01-01" notAfter="1200-12-31">after 1150 before 1200</birth><death notBefore="1200-01-01" notAfter="1280-12-31">after 1200 before 1280</death><sex value="M"/><nationality>Tibetan</nationality><idno type="APIS">7279</idno></person></listPerson><listBibl><bibl xml:id="work4518"><title type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">bla ma la bstod pa</title><title xml:lang="bo">བླ་མ་ལ་བསྟོད་པ</title><title type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">bla ma la bstod pa (incipit)</title><title type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">g+hu ru sta ba</title><title type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">shAkya'i dge slong gzhon nu byang chub la bstod pa (colophon)</title><textLang mainLang="bo"/><date type="composition" notBefore="1170-01-01" notAfter="1220-12-31">after 1170 before 1220</date><author ref="person:7279">Anonymous</author><note type="isExtant">True</note><note type="comment">Eulogy to the bla ma, following the text of the rGyal ba'i yum kyi bsdus pa'i don (ID:4516).&#13;
&#13;
The colophon suggests that it is an eulogy to 'Jad gzhon nu byang chub (ID:3863) - the author of the text that precedes on the manuscript - by a disciple, but it could be possible that the colophon is mistaken and that it is an eulogy, by 'Jad pa to his own bla ma, an hypothesis that could find some support in the two-line annotation in smaller script that follows, which distinguishes a "bla ma" from Shag kya'i dge slong gzhon nu byang chub.</note><relatedItem type="addressedTo" target="person:3863"/><idno type="APIS">4518</idno></bibl></listBibl><listRelation><relation xml:id="rel590" name="author-of" active="#person7279" passive="#work4518" type="uncertain"/></listRelation></standOff><text>
