         <gap reason="omitted"/><lb n="158a3"/><seg type="excerpt" xml:id="ex10032023-07-2412-45-03" status="reviewed">rgya gar skad du | <rs type="work" ana="corpusmd:named_reference" ref="work:4518">g+hu ru sta ba</rs> | bod skad du | <rs type="work" ana="corpusmd:named_reference" ref="work:4518">bla ma la bstod pa</rs> |</seg> 
