         <gap reason="omitted"/>

         

         <ab xml:space="preserve">
            <lb n="158a4"/><seg type="excerpt" xml:id="ex10032023-07-2412-45-04" status="reviewed">
         <lg><l>thugs sbyangs stobs kyis smra ba'i seng ger grags ||</l>
         <l>nyi zla bzhin du ma rig nyon mongs sel ||</l>
         <l>bsdu' bzhis bdag sogs 'gon med smin grol mdzad ||</l>
         <l>zung 'jug mtshan don ldan pa khyed la 'dud ||</l></lg>
         
        <lg> <l>chos kyis 'phongs pa'i <expan>sems can</expan> la ||</l>
         <l>rgyas 'bring rtogs pas tshim mdzad pa ||</l>
         <l><lb n="108a5"/> de bzhin bdag gis <expan>sems can</expan> rnams ||</l>
         <l>'phrin las rnaMs kyis tshim byed shog ||</l></lg>
         
         <lg><l>bla ma bde' bar gshegs pa'i gsung zab cing rgya che ba thugs<anchor xml:id="a1"/> su chud nas gzhan la ston pas 'khor ba'i mun nag du 'khyaMs pa'i long khrid pa ||<note type="translation">Having impressed on one's mind the profound and extensive teaching of the bla ma, the Sugata, by teaching it to others, (you|one) lead the blinds who are roving in the darkness of cyclic existence.</note></l>
         <l>dbu' ma chen pos gdul bya mngon mtho' nges legs la 'god pas thar pa dang <expan>thams cad</expan> mkhyen pa'i skyed byed ||<note type="translation">The Great Madhyamaka generates liberation and omniscience by establishing the disciples in higher states of rebirth and ultimate bliss.</note></l></lg></seg>
         </ab>
 <ab xml:space="preserve" type="colophon">
         <seg type="excerpt" xml:id="ex10032023-07-2412-45-052" status="finalized" ana="corpusmd:colophon"><milestone unit="section" n="Colophon (158a5–158a6)"/>
        <rs type="work" ana="corpusmd:named_reference" ref="work:4518"><rs type="person" ana="corpusmd:named_reference" ref="person:3863">shag kya'i dge' slong gzhon <lb n="158a6"/> nu byang chub</rs> la bstod pa</rs> || rdzogs s+h+y+o ||</seg>
        </ab>

         <ab xml:space="preserve" type="post_colophon">
         <seg type="excerpt" xml:id="ex10032024-09-1111-36-00" status="reviewed">
         <milestone unit="section" n="Addition (158a7–158a8)"/>
         <lb n="158a7"/> ࿓|| 
         <l>lnga brgya pa rnams kyi <expan>thams cad</expan> mkhyen pa rtog ge ba rnams kyi spyi gtsug gi rgyan | </l>
         <l><rs type="deity">bde' bar gshegs pa</rs>'i bka' rab <choice><corr>'byams</corr><sic>'byam</sic></choice> dri ma med pa'i gsal byed |</l> 
         <l>rmongs pa rnams kyi long khrid pa bla ma rnams kyi gsung gi rtogs pa'i myu gus rgyud brlan pa |</l>
         <l>mtshan thos pa tsam gyis 'gro ba skal ba dang ldan pa rnams kyi don mdzad spyod pa |</l>
         <l>dpag du med pa'i don 'byung pa'i gzhi rgyal ba skyed par byed pa'i rgyu'i gtso bo rgyas 'bring gsum rtogs pa'i shes rab thun mong <choice><corr>ma</corr><sic>ba</sic></choice> yin pa dang ldan pa'i <rs type="person" ana="corpusmd:unnamed_reference">bla ma</rs>s |</l>
         <l>dad pas rta la brtson 'grus <lb n="158a8"/> kyi lcag gis bskyod pa'i chos brgyad spangs pa'i chos kyi sbyin pa gnang ba'i dus su |</l>
         <l>gus pa dang dad pas gzhi bzung brtson 'grus dang shes rab kyis khyad par can gyi don la phyogs pa'i |</l>
         <l><rs type="person" ana="corpusmd:named_reference" ref="person:3863">shag kya'i dge slong gzhon nu byang chub</rs> kyis legs par mnyan pas |</l>
         <l>tshig dang don gyi rtogs pa phyin ci ma log pa mnyam pa med pa thob pa'i dge ba des skye bo kun yum la mos pa dang <rs type="person" ana="corpusmd:unnamed_reference" ref="person:4593">bdag</rs> nyid kyi rtogs pa brtan par 'byung par shog ||</l></seg>
         </ab>
